        <body>
            <div xml:id="d986">

                <pb facs="0752" n="636" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg636"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 123.Os4/121.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-22T00:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 22, 1914, midnight</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Having been handed my passports at 7.30 tonight, will leave tomorrow night or
                    Friday morning. What about Counsel General Shanklin and other consular officers?
                    Please instruct immediately.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson O’Shaughnessy</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
